        {
          "text": "Ohlanzekile kumelwe afafaze ongcolile ngosuku lwesithathu nangosuku lwesikhombisa; ngosuku lwesikhombisa uyakuzihlanza, ageze izingubo zakhe, ageze ngamanzi, kuthi kusihlwa ahlambuluke.",
