        },
        {
          "text": "Kepha umuntu ongcolile, angaziphothuli, lowo muntu uyakunqunywa ebandleni, ngokuba ungcolisile indlu engcwele kaJehova; amanzi okuhlukanisa awafafazwanga phezu kwakhe; ungcolile.",
